{
  "name": "GearUp 04 · Order Sync & Inventory",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4️⃣ Order → sheets → stock → alerts\nWebhook receives a new order (Shopify `orders/create` payload format).\n1. Normalize the order\n2. **Idempotency**: skip if the order was already processed (webhooks can be delivered twice)\n3. Save order + line items\n4. Decrease stock for every SKU\n5. Stock ≤ reorder level → Telegram alert to reorder\nNodes that talk to Google have retry (3×) + global error workflow.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f0ee3e28-800b-4a7e-8e1c-79987a5c94cc",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "gearup-order",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1222db6-99ba-47e4-821c-beb7954de343",
      "name": "New order webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "266f96be-03bb-4ee8-9389-1722bc50b0f0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $json.body || $json;\nconst lines = (o.line_items || []).map(li => ({ sku: String(li.sku || '').trim(), name: li.title || li.name || '', qty: Number(li.quantity) || 0, price: Number(li.price) || 0 }))\n  .filter(l => l.sku && l.qty > 0);\nif (!lines.length) throw new Error('Order has no valid line items: ' + (o.name || o.id));\nconst created = o.created_at ? String(o.created_at).slice(0,16).replace('T',' ') : $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  order_id: String(o.name || o.id).replace('#', ''),\n  created_at: created,\n  customer_name: [o.customer?.first_name, o.customer?.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' '),\n  customer_email: (o.email || '').toLowerCase(),\n  total: Number(o.total_price) || lines.reduce((s,l)=>s+l.qty*l.price,0),\n  status: 'processing', lines\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "13d5f906-785d-42e3-8abf-cada8cf462f3",
